  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vaccine donations Covid-19 channelled through EU to developing countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vaccine donations channeled through the European Commission. All vaccines are designated for ODA eligible countries. All vaccines reported are defined as &quot;in excess of domestic supply&quot; as they were not originally purchased with the sole intent of donating to ODA eligible countries.  Vaccines to COVAX/GAVI donated by type: 400 (Moderna) and 2000 (AZ). The average price of vaccine doses did not exceed the OECD/DAC reccommended average price of USD 6.66. For ODA calculation we have therefore downwards adjusted the figure to ensure that we do not report a higher figure than our actual outlay in 2022.</narrative>
  </description>
